<title>Australia: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to May 30.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in month</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1   Orogen Minerals	3.56    20.43</p>
<p> 2   M.I.M. Hlds	    1.96    17.37</p>
<p> 3   PMP Comms		3.60    15.76</p>
<p> 4   Wesfarmers	    12.20    15.53</p>
<p> 5   Flc-Energy Div	 4.20    13.51</p>
<p> 6   CSL Limited	    8.05    13.22</p>
<p> 7   QNI Ltd		  2.69    13.03</p>
<p> 8   Seven Network	  5.45    12.88</p>
<p> 9   C R A		   21.53    12.61</p>
<p>10   Comalco		  7.30    12.31</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in month</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1   Newcrest Mining	3.27   -14.17</p>
<p> 2   Burns,Philp &amp; Co     1.93    -9.39</p>
<p> 3   Centaur Min&amp;Expl     1.57    -7.65</p>
<p> 4   Crown		    2.10    -5.83</p>
<p> 5   Email		    4.07    -5.13</p>
<p> 6   Sthn Pac Pete	  3.65    -4.15</p>
<p> 7   Sons Of Gwalia	 5.49    -2.81</p>
<p> 8   Fosters Brew Grp     2.58    -2.27</p>
<p> 9   Hudson Conway	 12.95    -1.89</p>
<p>10   Plutonic Rsc	   4.81    -1.84</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
